OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AStaff gagging clauses lifted ahead of  
OL,4,Aprobe into culture at data watchdog    
OL,6,FA government spokesperson confirmed    
OL,7,Fthat NDAs, known as "gagging clauses", 
OL,8,Fwould not be enforced by the           
OL,9,FInformation Commission, saying the     
OL,10,Fregulator "will not use the terms of   
OL,11,Fany agreement to prevent people from   
OL,12,Fparticipating in the review".          
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
