OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws                 
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFight over fossil fuels leaves COP31   
OL,4,Aclimate talks in deadlock              
OL,6,FThis still remains the main sticking   
OL,7,Fpoint, along with a push from the      
OL,8,FAfrica Group to get commitments on more
OL,9,Fmoney for adaptation - but the EU has  
OL,10,Fpreviously said it would not support   
OL,11,Fthis.                                  
OL,13,FNegotiating teams due to fly out on    
OL,14,FSunday morning are now moving their    
OL,15,Fflights to Monday in a sign that a deal
OL,16,Fis not in sight.                       
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
